<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>I am a B.Com graduate. Why do I need this course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Because the degree taught concepts, not the desk. Employers test Tally speed, GST filing and payroll, none of which most colleges touch. This course converts your theory into the exact skills interviews check.</div></details>
<details><summary>Which software will I learn? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">TallyPrime in depth, Zoho Books for cloud accounting, the GST portal workflows, TRACES for TDS, and advanced Excel for MIS and reconciliations. All on realistic company data.</div></details>
<details><summary>Does this help with Gulf jobs? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Directly. A dedicated GCC module covers UAE and Saudi VAT, Tally for VAT and Gulf payroll expectations, the exact profile GCC accounts recruiters shortlist from Kerala.</div></details>
<details><summary>What is the starting salary for accounts roles? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Freshers typically start between Rs 2.5 and 4 lakh in India. With GST and payroll ownership, Rs 4 to 6.5 lakh follows quickly, and Gulf roles pay substantially more.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will AI replace accountants? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">AI is automating data entry, not accountability. Someone still configures, verifies and signs off compliance. We teach AI-assisted workflows so you move up the value chain rather than compete with software.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is this useful if I dropped CA or CMA? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Very. Your conceptual base is strong; this adds the practical software and filing skills that convert it into immediate employment while you decide your next attempt.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support and real introductions across 400+ partners, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
